&lt;li&gt;Identify and prioritize high-value prospects to drive accelerated territory growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with prospects sourced from marketing efforts and outbound campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master sales prospecting platforms and tools to optimize outreach efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Address customer challenges with relevant campaigns and events to increase engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong customer service relationships with prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly audit and refine your own activity to ensure accuracy and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively learn about Postman’s products, competitive landscape, and market trends through resources such as the company website, webinars, and other materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurately update lead status and record all prospect interactions in the CRM system daily.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become proficient in sales enablement tools to streamline and enhance your work.&lt;/li&gt;
